#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`scipy.optimize` --- Root finding and minimization"
msgstr ":mod:`scipy.optimize` --- 求根与最小化"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :mod:`scipy.optimize` submodule provides simple routines for finding "
"roots and minima of user-defined scalar functions. Because each iteration "
"must call back into the user-supplied Python callable, the speed gain over a"
" pure-Python implementation is modest (typically about 2x)."
msgstr ""
":mod:`scipy.optimize` 子模块提供了用于查找用户自定义标量函数的根和极小值的简单例程。由于每次迭代都必须回调到用户提供的 "
"Python 可调用对象，相比纯 Python 实现的速度提升有限（通常约为 2 倍）。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:14
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "函数"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:18
msgid ""
"Find a root of *f* in the bracket ``[a, b]`` using the bisection method. *f*"
" must change sign on the interval."
msgstr "使用二分法在区间 ``[a, b]`` 中查找 *f* 的根。\\ *f* 必须在该区间上变号。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:21
#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:48
#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:62
msgid "callable taking a single ``float`` and returning a ``float``."
msgstr "可调用对象，接受单个 ``float`` 并返回一个 ``float``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:22
msgid "left endpoint of the bracket."
msgstr "区间左端点。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:23
msgid "right endpoint of the bracket."
msgstr "区间右端点。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:24
msgid "absolute tolerance on the root location (default ``xtolerance``)."
msgstr "根位置的绝对容限（默认 ``xtolerance``\\ ）。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:26
msgid "maximum number of bisections (default ``100``)."
msgstr "最大二分次数（默认 ``100``\\ ）。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:27
#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:67
msgid "the location of the root as a ``float``."
msgstr "根的位置，类型为 ``float``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "抛出"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:28
msgid "if ``f(a) * f(b) > 0``."
msgstr "如果 ``f(a) * f(b) > 0``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:32
msgid ""
"Stub for non-linear least-squares curve fitting (Levenberg-Marquardt). "
"Present in the module table for API compatibility but currently a "
"placeholder: it accepts and validates its arguments but always returns "
"``None``. Prefer :func:`fmin` or external libraries until this routine is "
"implemented."
msgstr ""
"用于非线性最小二乘曲线拟合（Levenberg-Marquardt）的占位实现。为保持 API "
"兼容性而存在于模块表中，但目前仅是一个占位符：它接受并验证其参数，但始终返回 ``None``\\ 。在此例程实现之前，请优先使用 "
":func:`fmin` 或外部库。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:38
msgid "model callable ``f(x, *params) -> float``."
msgstr "模型可调用对象 ``f(x, *params) -> float``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:39
msgid "1-D array-like of independent values."
msgstr "自变量值的一维类数组对象。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:40
msgid "1-D array-like of dependent values, same length as *xdata*."
msgstr "因变量值的一维类数组对象，长度与 *xdata* 相同。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:41
msgid "1-D array-like of initial parameter estimates."
msgstr "初始参数估计的一维类数组对象。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:45
msgid ""
"Find the position of a local minimum of the scalar function *f* using the "
"downhill simplex (Nelder-Mead) method."
msgstr "使用下降单纯形（Nelder-Mead）方法查找标量函数 *f* 的局部极小值的位置。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:49
#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:63
msgid "initial guess."
msgstr "初始猜测值。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:50
msgid "absolute tolerance on the position (default ``xtolerance``)."
msgstr "位置的绝对容限（默认 ``xtolerance``\\ ）。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:52
msgid "absolute tolerance on the function value (default ``xtolerance``)."
msgstr "函数值的绝对容限（默认 ``xtolerance``\\ ）。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:54
msgid "maximum number of iterations (default ``200``)."
msgstr "最大迭代次数（默认 ``200``\\ ）。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:55
msgid "the location of the minimum as a ``float``."
msgstr "极小值的位置，类型为 ``float``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:59
msgid ""
"Find a zero of the real-valued, scalar function *f* by the Newton-Raphson "
"(secant) method."
msgstr "使用 Newton-Raphson（割线）方法查找实值标量函数 *f* 的零点。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:64
msgid "absolute tolerance on the root (default ``xtolerance``)."
msgstr "根的绝对容限（默认 ``xtolerance``\\ ）。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:65
msgid "relative tolerance on the root (default ``rtolerance``)."
msgstr "根的相对容限（默认 ``rtolerance``\\ ）。"

#: ../../library/omv.ulab.scipy.optimize.rst:66
msgid "maximum number of iterations (default ``50``)."
msgstr "最大迭代次数（默认 ``50``\\ ）。"
